      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "糸を通した針を持ったシロタエさんは\n手慣れた手付きで、穴の空いてしまった\n僕のズボンを縫ってくれていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "01295e186ca0c13052861746d78d1f6e0a8f6e6daebe667647b8b2638bb2115c",
